{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FOR ALL TODDLER PARENTS EVERYWHERE. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cloud Popper is here to bring you a moment of peace, keeping curious minds entertained searching for what might be under the next cloud, and developing point-and-click accuracy(via mouse or controller).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This simple game allows even the smallest kids to play so they can copy you/your partner without frustration at the controls not working for them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay is focussed on hovering over the clouds to highlight them and popping the clouds by clicking them and uncover the hidden image below, once all of the clouds have been popped there is a reload button(loads new clouds to pop) or back button(return to main menu shown in image).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725010/extras/492bdea368a5df11b4af6d8dcc88247e.avif?t=1752187227\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cloud Popper is a solution to in-browser or keyboard smash style games causing absolute chaos on the PC/machine as soon as chore began, the exit game button is therefore small and tucked away(see above), hopefully not too appealing to little hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Pop 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3725010/c648e8b3c1fc4b2872d54e7c65530c73ce2cc5c3.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3725010?t=1752187227","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3725010?t=1752187227","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725010/9cd6cebd6f244cb62030a7874c12d14389562374/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752187227","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725010/9cd6cebd6f244cb62030a7874c12d14389562374/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752187227","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FOR ALL TODDLER PARENTS EVERYWHERE. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cloud Popper is here to bring you a moment of peace, keeping curious minds entertained searching for what might be under the next cloud, and developing point-and-click accuracy(via mouse or controller).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This simple game allows even the smallest kids to play so they can copy you/your partner without frustration at the controls not working for them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay is focussed on hovering over the clouds to highlight them and popping the clouds by clicking them and uncover the hidden image below, once all of the clouds have been popped there is a reload button(loads new clouds to pop) or back button(return to main menu shown in image).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725010/extras/492bdea368a5df11b4af6d8dcc88247e.avif?t=1752187227\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cloud Popper is a solution to in-browser or keyboard smash style games causing absolute chaos on the PC/machine as soon as chore began, the exit game button is therefore small and tucked away(see above), hopefully not too appealing to little hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Maya"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image